---
/**
 * The not-found page, Hebrew. Built like every other route — same
 * backdrop, same chrome, same floor — because the most useful thing a
 * wrong URL can do is put the reader back in the site rather than on a
 * bare error screen: the header's nav is right there, and so is the way
 * home.
 *
 * Cloudflare serves this for any unmatched path on a static deploy
 * (`assets.not_found_handling: "404-page"` in wrangler.jsonc), so it has
 * to be a real page and not a fragment.
 *
 * ITS RUSSIAN TWIN IS src/pages/ru/404.astro, and the split is forced:
 * see NotFound.astro.
 *
 * CONFIRMED AGAINST THE DEPLOYED SITE: "404-page" does NOT walk up from
 * the requested path looking for the nearest 404.html. It always serves
 * the root one — this file. `https://sensorika.co.il/ru/anything-wrong`
 * returns this Hebrew page, not /ru/404.
 *
 * So ru/404.astro is currently reachable only at its own URL and is not
 * what a Russian visitor sees when they mistype. That's a degradation,
 * not a break: this page carries the full header, so the nav and the
 * language switcher are right there and the switcher's link resolves to
 * `/ru` — one click back into Russian. It is also exactly what the site
 * did for everyone before Russian existed.
 *
 * FIXING IT PROPERLY MEANS GIVING UP THE NO-WORKER DEPLOY. Static-assets
 * `not_found_handling` is one setting for the whole site, so serving a
 * different 404 per path prefix needs request-time logic — a Worker
 * script with an ASSETS binding, plus `main` in wrangler.jsonc, which
 * that file's opening comment explains the site deliberately does
 * without. That trade (a worker, for a localised 404 on mistyped URLs)
 * is worth making only if the Russian side turns out to attract them.
 *
 * The locale is passed to NotFound explicitly — see there for why this
 * is the one page that states its language rather than deriving it.
 */
import Footer from '../components/layout/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/layout/Header.astro';
import PageBackdrop from '../components/layout/PageBackdrop.astro';
import SideNav from '../components/layout/SideNav.astro';
import NotFound from '../components/sections/NotFound.astro';
import { ui } from '../data/i18n';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const t = ui('he');
---

<BaseLayout title={t.notFoundTitle} description={t.notFoundDescription}>
  <PageBackdrop />
  <Header />
  <SideNav />

  <main id="main">
    <NotFound locale="he" />
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
